The Chinese text under site/zh/ is not licensed under MIT. All rights are
reserved except where fair use applies by law. Each episode page labels its
form:

- "中文精读" (reading), episodes 1, 2, 4 and 5: commentary (episodes 1 and 5,
  the latter with a short story by the author) or reorganized Chinese
  renderings (episodes 2 and 4) written by 时初白 from publicly released
  interviews and talks. They are not official transcripts and are not
  authorized by the original rights holders; the upstream content remains
  theirs, and this site claims no rights in it.
- "原创作品" (original), episode 3: original writing by 时初白. All rights are
  held by the site owner.

